would signal to isolate_folios() that the current reclaim type is completely
empty, triggering a premature fallback to the other reclaim type and breaking
the cost-based reclaim balancing logic."

This is a good point. We could break out of a zone once
skipped_zone >= MIN_LRU_BATCH, provided the zone still
contains folios.

